        "jsonData": "={{ [{\"text\": \"RAG stands for Retrieval-Augmented Generation. It is a technique that combines information retrieval with text generation to provide more accurate and contextual AI responses.\"}, {\"text\": \"Vector stores are databases optimized for storing and searching high-dimensional vectors, commonly used in RAG systems to find relevant documents.\"}, {\"text\": \"Embeddings are numerical representations of text that capture semantic meaning, allowing AI to understand similarity between documents.\"}] }}",
